<p>
<pb facs="StadtASG_Missive_1796_6637.jpg" n="1"/>
<lb n="1"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Unsere</unclear> freundtliche undt willige dienste <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">zuvorn</unclear>, Erbare, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">Fuersichtige</unclear> undt Wolweise, besonders <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">guenstige</unclear> guete
<lb n="2"/>Freunde, wir koennen <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">euch</unclear> auß <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">betruebtem</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">gemuethe</unclear> nicht verhalten, <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">welcher</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">maßen</unclear> alhier in unser stadt
<lb n="3"/>den <origDate resp="#ner">21. Augusti stylo veteri juengsthin</origDate>-hinen in der nacht <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">zwischen</unclear> zehen und <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">eilff</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">uhren</unclear> durch Gottes ver-
<lb n="4"/><unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">hengknueß</unclear> ein <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">unversehenes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">feuer</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">auffgangen</unclear> und <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">vermittelß</unclear> eines <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">erhabenen</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">starcken</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">windes</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">dermaßen</unclear>
<lb n="5"/><unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">oberhand</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">genommen</unclear>, <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">daß</unclear> <unclear cert="low" resp="#joint">ohngefehr</unclear> in <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">achzehen</unclear> stunden der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">groeste</unclear> und beste theil der <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">stadt</unclear> <unclear cert="medium" resp="#joint">innerhalb</unclear> der
